      "reflection in y = 1:  matrix([1,0,0],[0,-1,2],[0,0,1])\nimage of (3, 4) =  [3,-2]   (expect [3, −2])\nS² =  matrix([1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0,0,1])   (an involution)"
     ]
    }
